From b3c5aa2ca5bf03906c42fe171beea32adce4c4cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Youll <andrewyoull86@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 08:43:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] avcodec: hevc_hwdec, HEVC on the Raspberry Pi 4's HEVC block
 (RISC OS)

The hwaccel hevc_hwdec, on the HEVC decoder (8-bit and 10-bit 4:2:0):
each picture given to riscos-reelhwaccel's hevcdec as the V4L2 stateless
HEVC controls, its frames hevcdec's (AV_PIX_FMT_HEVCDEC). And the decoder
hevc_hwdec: the HEVC decoder with that hwaccel inside it, its pictures
given out as YUV420P frames (YUV420P10 for 10-bit streams).
--enable-libhevcdec (GPL), needs hwhevcdec.h and libhevcdec.
---
 configure               |   8 +
 libavcodec/Makefile     |   1 +
 libavcodec/allcodecs.c  |   1 +
 libavcodec/hevc_hwdec.c | 882 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 libavcodec/hevcdec.c    |  10 +
 libavcodec/hwaccels.h   |   1 +
 libavutil/pixdesc.c     |   4 +
 libavutil/pixfmt.h      |   6 +
 8 files changed, 913 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 libavcodec/hevc_hwdec.c

